mpaign. Reaching out to prior cherry customers, he uncovered 300 interested buyers for his walnuts. This approach resulted in his gross revenue tripling against wholesale prices, proving that even a small customer base can boost income stability. Consequently, many farmers are now embracing direct sales strategies to lessen financial uncertainties.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2024-a-california-walnut-farmer-turned-a-small-email-experiment-into-a-major-change-in-his-business-just-300-of-10000-cherry-customers-opted-in-yet-direct-sales-helped-triple-his-walnut-crops-gross-revenue/articleshow/135219290.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/in-2024-a-california-walnut-farmer-turned-a-small-email-experiment-into-a-major-change-in-his-business-just-300-of-10000-cherry-customers-opted-in-yet-direct-sales-helped-triple-his-walnut-crops-gross-revenue/articleshow/135219290.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T06:55:00+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135219307,imgsize-2222500.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Saudi defence pact countries push for peace in Iran]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135222262.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/saudi-defence-pact-countries-push-for-peace-in-iran/articleshow/135222262.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/saudi-defence-pact-countries-push-for-peace-in-iran/articleshow/135222262.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T06:25:29+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135222273,imgsize-107418.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Delaware sinks 180-foot fishing vessel to create offshore reef, but fish population remain unmeasured]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135217057.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[In a strategic move to enhance marine ecosystems, the retired fishing vessel F/V Calcasieu Pass has been sunk off the Delaware coast to function as an artificial reef. This initiative, aimed at supporting diverse aquatic species, involved meticulously clearing hazardous materials before the sinking. Environmental authorities will oversee the area, monitoring the growth and health of the marine habitats it spawns in the years to come.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/delaware-sank-a-retired-180-foot-fishing-vessel-in-august-2026-after-it-was-transferred-for-just-1-now-it-forms-an-artificial-reef-about-26-miles-offshore-although-no-increase-in-fish-populations-has-yet-been-measured/articleshow/135217057.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/delaware-sank-a-retired-180-foot-fishing-vessel-in-august-2026-after-it-was-transferred-for-just-1-now-it-forms-an-artificial-reef-about-26-miles-offshore-although-no-increase-in-fish-populations-has-yet-been-measured/articleshow/135217057.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-27T05:59:56+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135217310,imgsize-969195.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Brazil bucks regional shift to right, brings back Lula]]></title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135222016.cms" /&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/rest-of-world/brazil-bucks-regional-shift-to-right-brings-back-lula/articleshow/135222016